<hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Lieder-Buch</hi></hi></titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="sub"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">zum Privat-Gebrauch<lb/>
fu&#x0364;r Kinder</hi></hi><lb/>
und<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">fu&#x0364;r junge Chri&#x017F;ten</hi><lb/>
reiferen Alters.</hi><lb/>
</titlePart> </docTitle> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<byline> Aus den be&#x017F;ten<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Schrift&#x017F;tellern und Dichtern</hi></hi><lb/>
